Agoto played the lead role of a quiet but determined resort worker at a high-end golf club in the film, which explores themes of gentrification, class and globalization. She also starred in the original short film, Filipi&#xF1;ana (2020), that the feature was based on. Also directed by Manuel, the short film won a Silver Bear Jury Prize at the Berlinale.

Born in Ilocos, Philippines, on September 25, 1994, Agoto started acting in community theatre at a young age before graduating with a BA in Theater Arts from Polytechnic University of the Philippines. She also had roles in short films including Cross My Heart And Hope To Die and features such as Jun Robles Lana&#x2019;s Sisa , which premiered at Tallinn Black Nights Film Festival in 2025, and Lawrence Fajardo&#x2019;s Silenced Nights , which premiered at this year&#x2019;s Toronto International Film Festival.

The Film Development Council of the Philippines (FDCP) also issued a statement following the news of her passing: &#x201C;The Film Development Council of the Philippines extends its deepest condolences to the family and loved ones of Ms. Jorrybell Agoto &#x2014; Lead Actress, Filipi&#xF1;ana (1994&#x2013;2026). Your contribution to the Philippine film industry will remain etched in our hearts. Thank you so much, and farewell, Jorrybell.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dl-mid-article-inject2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article2","mid-articleX","mid-article","mid","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

Kino Lorber, which is distributing Filipi&#xF1;ana in the U.S., also remembered the young actress and paid tribute to her talent: &#x201C;While we never met Jorrybell, we felt like we had through the light she brought to Isabel in &#x2018; Filipi&#xF1;ana &#x2019;. Cinema is poorer for having lost her so young.&#x201D;

Filipi&#xF1;ana is being released in the UK and Ireland this weekend by BFI Distribution. Kino Lorber released the film in the U.S. in August and is currently organizing a series of screenings as part of its Oscar campaign.

The Bentonville Film Festival will return for its 13th year June 14-20, renewing its partnership with Variety &#x2019;s 10 Producers to Watch for its third consecutive year.

Founded in 2015 by Geena Davis, the festival fosters and celebrates authentic storytelling through film screenings, industry conversations and community experiences.

&#x201C;Over the past 12 years, BFF has championed the artistry of thousands of talented filmmakers, creating opportunities to showcase stories that have been overlooked,&#x201D; Davis said. &#x201C;As we look ahead to 2027, we remain committed to expanding our reach, connecting filmmakers with audiences and celebrating the power of storytelling to bring people together.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories 'Kantara: A Legend,' 'The Kerala Story 2,' Volker Schlondorff's 'Visitation' Among 15 Films in Goa Festival International Competition Jazz Documentary 'Tokyo in 33 RPM' Unveiled Ahead of India's WAVES Film Bazaar (EXCLUSIVE)

Leigh Hopkins has also been appointed to BFFoundation&#x2019;s board of directors after previously serving as the executive vice president and regional CEO for Asia and Mexico for Walmart International.

&#x201C;We are thrilled to welcome Leigh to the BFFoundation board,&#x201D; said Wendy Guerrero, the president and CEO of BFFoundation and the BFF. &#x201C;His leadership experience, commitment to community and understanding of the region will be valuable as we continue to grow the festival, strengthen our partnerships and expand opportunities for filmmakers and audiences.&#x201D;

Hopkins added, &#x201C;I'm delighted to join the BFFoundation board and be part of a festival that not only brings outstanding films to Bentonville, but also creates meaningful community connections through its year-round programming and events. It's an honor to help shape what's ahead for BFF.&#x201D;

The 2026 festival featured 34 feature competition films, with winners including Walter Thompson-Hern&#xE1;ndez&#x2019;s &#x201C;If I Go Will They Miss Me&#x201D; for best narrative and Judd Ehrlich&#x2019;s &#x201C;Jane Elliott Against the World&#x201D; for best documentary. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

