The Families Stone picks up 20 years after the death of Diane Keaton's character, matriarch Sybil Stone &#x2014; something that was depicted in the original film &#x2014; as the Stone family again reunites for Christmas, only to face the season's biggest surprise: their father (Craig T. Nelson) has unexpectedly invited the woman (Jean Smart) he's fallen in love with to meet the family.

Following Keaton's death at age 79 in October 2025, Bezucha revealed that he was writing the sequel , which was set at Searchlight in September and is now filming in New York. In addition to Mulroney, Nelson and Wilson, original cast members Claire Danes, Rachel McAdams, Sarah Jessica Parker, Tyrone Giordano, Elizabeth Reaser, Paul Schneider and Brian White are returning.
